  Welcome to self-host

  self-host runs the Apps you pick on this machine with Docker Compose, and
  sets them up for you: one Admin login, their API keys and the Links
  between them.

  Next you choose what to run, where it lives, who administers it and how
  it looks. Then you review the plan.

  Nothing is written until you approve the plan at Review.

  Anonymous usage and error data is sent. Turn off: SELF_HOST_NO_TELEMETRY=1







